# Ignore everything by default
*

# Publish only these files
!.gitignore
!index.html
!plenee_legal.html
!privacy.html
!terms.html
!contact.html
!RAM.svg
!CNAME
!SECURITY.md
!Logo - Plenee_Navigator.svg
!Logo - Plenee_Navigator_v2.svg

# Shared nav, used by every page on the site AND every Academy page. Without these three
# the nav 404s: unstyled, no account menu, no compass. The mark is the nav's logo now that
# the lockup is HTML text beside it.
!nav.css
!nav.js
!plenee_icon2.svg

# Plenee Academy. git-ignore rules can't negate into an already-excluded directory without
# first un-ignoring the directory itself, hence the paired lines.
# academy2/ is gone: v2 moved to /academy/ on 2026-09-01 and Academy v1 was retired with it.
!academy/
!academy/**
